      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo are delighted to present this superb end-of-terrace home to the market. Built in 1960 and having been in the same family since, the property has been excellently maintained and upgraded over the years, with great potential for a new owner to now make it their own. The property also benefits from a large garage at the rear which is currently in use as a studio/workshop and would suit a variety of uses with rear access to the laneway behind the property. Superbly located in this mature residential estate, the property will appeal to first-time buyers and families looking to trade up to a larger home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, front reception room, rear sitting room, kitchen/dining room, WC, and ground floor bedroom which could be used as a home office or 3rd living room/playroom. There is also a conservatory/lean-to at the rear of the house with access into the garden. Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms and a family bathroom. The rear garden is laid out in patio and lawn with the aforementioned garage also. At the front is a large driveway with ample parking space for multiple cars.\r\n\r\nArea Info\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an enviable location close to a number of local amenities such as shops, restaurants, cafés, bars and leisure clubs. Artane Castle Shopping Centre is 700m away. There are a number of excellent schools in the immediate vicinity including St John of Gods and St David’s, in addition to multiple childcare facilities. Beaumont Hospital is also a very short distance away.\r\n\r\nFor outdoor enthusiasts St Annes Park is within walking distance while Dollymount Strand is a short drive away. Both Killester and Harmonstown DART stations are an 18 minute walk away and there are a number of bus routes on your doorstep. The M50 can be reached in 5 minutes while Dublin city centre is a 10 minute drive.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
